WEBVTT

00:13:59.714 --> 00:14:05.199
Madre, madre, madre
Salva tuo figlio

00:14:08.374 --> 00:14:11.839
Vai, sii libero

00:14:12.571 --> 00:14:16.133
Vai, sii libero

00:14:16.895 --> 00:14:20.150
Vai, sii libero

00:14:20.761 --> 00:14:22.894
Non voglio un letto comprato in negozio

00:14:23.213 --> 00:14:24.618
Vai

00:14:24.642 --> 00:14:27.459
Voglio le nuvole sulla testa

00:14:27.483 --> 00:14:28.634
Sii libero

00:14:28.658 --> 00:14:30.848
Non c’è tempo per aver paura